<Layout
	title="Pairing Pastries with Chai & Coffee | Sula Chai Café Vancouver"
	description="The quiet ritual of choosing the right pastry. Why a buttery croissant and a strong masala chai belong together, and other pastry pairings worth your time."
	canonical="/blog/pastries-coffee-pairing"
